    US_SYS_01 --> Sub1_1[Process recurring renewals and prorations]
    US_SYS_01 --> Sub1_2[Gracefully downgrade access on payment failure]

    US_SYS_02 --> Sub2_1[Fetch exchange rates periodically]
    US_SYS_02 --> Sub2_2[Compute dual-currency transactions accurately]

