    US_SYS_03 --> Sub3_2[Publish real-time WebSocket status updates]

    US_SYS_04 --> Sub4_1[Observe internal events like Lead stage changes]
    US_SYS_04 --> Sub4_2[Execute user-configured automation rules]

    US_SYS_05 --> Sub5_1[Securely receive and validate external webhooks]
    US_SYS_05 --> Sub5_2[Map webhooks to internal state changes]

    US_SYS_06 --> Sub6_1[Actively monitor request velocities and enforce rate limits]
    US_SYS_06 --> Sub6_2[Block malicious patterns to protect the ecosystem]
